This repository contains a preliminary technical report and supplementary
result summaries describing research on TreeMoTE, a parse-given tree-
recursive neural evaluator for compositional depth generalization.

Permission is granted to read, cite, and reference this report and its
contents for academic, journalistic, or personal-research purposes,
provided that:

1. Citation is given to the author and the technical report.
2. Substantive excerpts (figures, tables, more than two consecutive
   paragraphs) attribute the source.
3. The contents are not redistributed in modified form without
   acknowledgement of the modifications and their authors.

